MID_SE_Fab_Mic_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_C_001: This is a mere collection of dubious folklore,\ncontaining little more than superstition. Ah well.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_C_002: One might even say my magic could be termed spirit\nmagic... One might.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_C_003: That's quite a book you've got there. Doing some\nlight reading?
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_C_004: Quite. It is so far from enriching my knowledge it\ncould count as little else. Am I needed?
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_C_005: Actually, I do have a question for you. I was\nwondering how old you are.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_C_006: I think you're probably younger than me? But I\nwanted to check.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_C_007: Hm. A reasonable assumption. And so?
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_C_008: Well, then... Listen, Fabio. I'm not going to\nsugarcoat this. You need to train more.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_C_009: I beg your pardon? I fail to see your point. Perhaps\nyou may expound your reasoning.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_C_010: My reasoning? Well, let's talk about the fact that\nyou're so frail it looks like you might snap.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_C_011: If you were older, I might let it go, but you're younger\nthan me! We have to do something!
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_C_012: Ah. I understand. Your concern is unwarranted. As a\nmagic user, I do not have need of physical fortitude.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_C_013: What? Everybody needs a healthy body! You're a\nsmart guy. I'm sure you get it.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_C_014: If this is how you look now, think about 10 years'\ntime! You're going to waste away.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_C_015: There is sense in what you say, but please\nunderstand that I do expend effort toward upkeep.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_C_016: Upkeep? You need to sweat! First thing, we need to\nbuild up your endurance. We'll go for a light run.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_C_017: Let go of my arm, please. The sun of this land is\nunendurable to me! I cannot simply go outside!
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_C_018: Don't like it? Go ahead and try to shake me off. The\nkey to building endurance is to face obstacles!
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_C_019: *wheeze* *wheeze* What humiliation...
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_C_020: I'd love to say that was a good start, but it was\nbarely a start—just a scenic jog!
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_C_021: Oh well. I guess that'll have to do for today. I'm going\nto keep going while there's still sun!
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_C_022: For today? Meddlesome beast! I must devise a plan\nto rid myself of this burden, else I will surely perish...
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_B_001: Fabio! Come on—let's go train! It's beautiful out!
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_B_002: How many times must I refuse? Has her hearing\nfailed her? I must remain hidden...
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_B_003: Locked. This won't be pretty, but... Here we go!
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_B_004: She is still out there, scheming... This bodes ill.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_B_005: Fabio! Step away from the door! Rah!
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_B_006: He's not here! Looks like he took off through\nthe window.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_B_007: My decision to hide was correct, but I could never\nhave anticipated that brute would burst in like that.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_B_008: Her tenacity is intriguing... What is its source? I must\nascertain this.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_B_009: {SetColor=Gray}Hmm... I need to get Fabio fired up for training, but\nhow? He's so stubborn, just like that girl.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_B_010: {SetColor=Gray}Sure, waving a branch around isn't that interesting.\nBut he's not fit enough for anything heavier.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_B_011: My concern is not that it is uninteresting.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_B_012: Oh, Fabio! Are you finally ready to train?
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_B_013: Not at all. I observed your ruminations and saw this\nas an opportune juncture to attempt dialogue.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_B_014: It seems you have compared me to a girl you know.\nTell me of her.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_B_015: Oh, you heard that? Well, I might as well explain.\nI'm talking about Mu, my daughter.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_B_016: Oh, you heard that? Well, I might as well explain.\nI'm talking about my daughter, Mu. She's with Leda.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_B_017: She's got a talent for magic—same as you. And she's\nalways reading books—same as you.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_B_018: This beggars belief. Your motivation for training me\nwas a similarity this superficial?
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_B_019: Sure. Because if I know one thing, I know that both\nof you are smarter than me.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_B_020: And because of it, I want to use the knowhow I\nhave to help the both of you.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_B_021: {SetColor=Gray}This makes little sense, but by now I can confirm\nthat this opponent is resolute and immovable.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_B_022: I perceive that rebutting this argument will not end\nit. I shall tailor my strategy to your proclivities.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_B_023: Come again? Try using normal words.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_B_024: I aim for a conclusion to satisfy both parties. But I\nrequire time to formulate a plan...
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_A_001: Dinner's ready! Spicy stew with pumpkin, just like\nyou asked.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_A_002: What an inviting aroma. Let us eat with all haste.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_A_003: Did you like it? I hope so. After all, I wasn't\nexpecting you to ask me to cook for you.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_A_004: Maintaining this body necessitates\nhigh-grade nutrition.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_A_005: The gourd used in this dish contains a compound\nthat, when heated, slows the visible signs of aging.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_A_006: Huh. Guess you learned that from a book too?\nSmart cookie.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_A_007: It was easily gleaned. And I would ask that you make\nthis dish again, if possible.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_A_008: Sure! Leave it to me. If you're happy to eat it, I'm\nhappy to cook it!
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_A_009: Hmhmhm. That would be most welcome. As is this\nresult... Most welcome.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_A_010: Not only have I sublimated your impulse, it has\nbecome a source of my sustenance.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_A_011: I never get what you mean, but I'm glad you're\nhappy. And you say what you think, unlike Mu.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_A_012: Though between the two of you, I don't know who\ncomplains more.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_A_013: But at least our conversations don't end in a fight!\nThat's a point in your favor.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_A_014: And still you compare me to your offspring. I am\nat a loss.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_A_015: Would it not be more apt to compare me to an adult\nman? Perhaps your husband?
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_A_016: You kidding? I have no interest in talking about that\nlouse. Besides, you're a better man than him.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_A_017: Hold on... Did you ask me to make you a\nhome-cooked meal because you...
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_A_018: Wait, please. You seem to be burdened with an\nabsurd misconception.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_A_019: Don't be embarrassed, now! I should apologize, just\nblurting that out. I was surprised, is all.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_A_020: Embarrassed? Far from it. Now come! Your face has\noverheated. You may wish to cool it with water.
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_A_021: Oh, Fabio! How kind of you to worry. But... After\nhow my marriage ended, I need time to think...
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_A_022: So please be patient with me. As soon as I can, I'll\nanswer. Though maybe I already know what to say...
MID_SE_Fab_Mic_A_023: I thought I had this beast penned! But no. How has it\ncome to this?